# WorldNav → EarthRelay cloud connection
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and uncomment the vars to switch OFF the local
# simulator and talk to the live cloud. Per FRONTEND_HANDOFF.md §0, only enable
# these once the routes return `200 application/x-ndjson` (run the §8 probe).
#
# As of the last probe: /health is live (200), but /orchestrate and
# /agent/ingest are NOT yet contract-ready (400/404, no CORS preflight) —
# leave these unset so the app keeps using its built-in simulator.

# Stage A — feed aggregation. Streams CloudStreamChunk (NDJSON).
# VITE_ORCHESTRATOR_URL=https://earthrelay.fly.dev/orchestrate

# Stage B — synthesis agent (the 5×3 RegionBriefing). Streams BriefingChunk (NDJSON).
# VITE_AGENT_URL=https://earthrelay.fly.dev/agent/ingest

# Optional, frontend-only extension (NOT in FRONTEND_HANDOFF.md): a narrative
# summary endpoint for the left "Cloud Agent" panel. If unset, that panel uses
# its local simulator. Point it at a route returning SummaryChunk (NDJSON).
# VITE_AGENT_SUMMARY_URL=
